; WARNING AN EXCLUSION FOLLOWS ITS NEST, AND THE NESTS MOVED (the 2026-08-28 layout rebuild). One shared Exclusion_roost
; at (0, 0) worked only while all three lairs sat at the exact centre of their cell, which is
; precisely the sameness the rebuild removed. Each roost now names its own, centred on where its Nest
; node actually is: the wild dragon at (-14, -20) against the north ice wall, the ash dragon at
; (10, 6) in the crater, the Ancient at (-6, -18) inside the crescent. A scatter that kept clear of
; (0, 0) instead would grow dead pines through all three of them.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Exclusion_dragon_roost"]
script = ExtResource("8_exclusion")
Center = Vector2(-14, -20)
Radius = 15.0

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Exclusion_ash_roost"]
script = ExtResource("8_exclusion")
Center = Vector2(10, 6)
Radius = 15.0

; The ash roost causeway is the other thing nothing may grow in: it is a 34 m exposed approach, and a
