; WARNING THE HOLD HAS THREE ROADS AND THEY ARE ITS THREE SEAMS (the 2026-08-28 layout rebuild), and none of them crosses
; the moot ring. The old cross ran (-23, 5) to (23, 5) straight through where the clan stands, and the
; approach ran the full length of the cell down x = 0. Every seam point below is arithmetic, not taste:
;   west  (-30, 0)  the wild dragon roost - its approach path starts at roost-local (45, 0), which is
;                   world (70, -20), which is this cell local (-30, 0).
;   east  (30, 0)   the ash roost - its approach starts at ash-local (-50, 0) = world (130, -20).
;   north (0, -30)  the glacier pass - its pass path starts at glacier-local (0, 10) = world (100, -50).
; The spawn at world (100, 1.2, 0) is cell-local (0, 20): the open southern ground below the ring.
